      "type": "xtu-rich-content",
      "blocks": {
        "richtext_dDzA7i": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "body": "<p>Record the road ahead in 4K, monitor the cabin in 1080P and capture the road behind in 4K—all at the same time for more complete protection on every journey. <strong>Ideal for Rideshare & Professional Drivers:</strong> For Uber, Lyft, taxi, and delivery drivers, the interior camera adds an extra layer of protection by recording passenger interactions and helping resolve disputes with reliable video evidence.<br/><br/></p>",
